From: Proton CRM <noreply@proton.local>
Subject: [PATCH] Escalation Routing: tabs, drawers and a Needs attention list

The page was one long scroll of always-open forms above wide tables edited
inline. It becomes four tabs (Overview, Departments, dealers, Ladder) in
?tab=; lists open a side drawer to edit; the Overview says what is
misconfigured (a dealer with no Principal skips step 3) and what is in
flight; the ladder is an Off / Dry run / Live choice over the same two
stored booleans, drawn as a timeline. Every request, body and permission
is unchanged. Design: claude.ai canvas "Escalation Routing Refresh".
---
